<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine March unemployment rises to 1.70 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine March unemployment rises to 1.70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Ukraine rose to 1.70 percent of the labour force in March, or 468,931 unemployed, from 1.56 percent or 431,951 in February, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> UKRAINIAN UNEMPLOYMENT    March 97    Feb 97    March 96</p>
<p> number of unemployed	468,931     431,951   199,904</p>
<p> pct of labour force	 1.70	  1.56	  n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Official information in Ukraine, with a population of 51 million people, tends to understate unemployment levels.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244 9150</p>
</text>
